        "body": "Source (twilite repository; the files still carry the old name):\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/viewResolution.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/viewSequence.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/surfaceChains.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/graphViewPresentation.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/components/WorkspaceLayer.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/viewResolution.test.js`\n- `tests/viewSequence.test.js`\n- `tests/graphViewPresentation.test.js`\n- `tests/workspaceCamera.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior.",
